    "created_at": "2016-08-01T04:16:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-01T04:16:30Z",
    "body": "Want to see something weird? Try http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=4349 in Firefox.\n\nOK, so I think this is fixed, although as you note the parent relationship is wrong. I will file another issue for that. It seems like it might involve some investigation given cases where e.g. divs wrap only some lis and not others, or nested ols or uls or whatever.\n",
